  id: Q2
  textDA: "Hvorfor kan det v\xE6re sv\xE6rt for to pandaer at bo sammen i l\xE6ngere
    tid? "
  textEN: Why can it be difficult for pandas to live toghether for longer periods
    of time?
  multiSelect: 0
  showLetters: 1
  horizontalLayout: 0
  logAsNumber: 0
  options:
  - textDA: "De sk\xE6ndes hele tiden."
    textEN: They fight all of the time.
    correct: 0
    exclusive: 0
    icon: {fileID: 0}
  - textDA: 'De spiser forskellig slags bambus. '
    textEN: They eat different kinds of bamboo.
    correct: 0
    exclusive: 0
    icon: {fileID: 0}
  - textDA: De deler den samme bambus, som hurtigt bliver brugt op.
    textEN: They share the same bamboo, which gets used up quickly.
    correct: 1
    exclusive: 0
    icon: {fileID: 0}
  - textDA: 'De kan ikke se hinanden i skoven. '
    textEN: They can't see each other in the forest.
    correct: 0
    exclusive: 0
    icon: {fileID: 0}
